OL,3,AUK Town of Culture bid withdrawn in    
OL,4,AStrabane after it causes 'great        
OL,5,Adivision'                              
OL,7,FThe motion, which was put forward by   
OL,8,Findependent councillors, was backed by 
OL,9,Fthe Social Democratic and Labour Party 
OL,10,F(SDLP) and Sinn Fein.                  
